  "job_B1.4.16_20251001_193231": {
    "chunk_text": "Matheus se godspellere, \u00fee w\u00e6s mid Criste on life, and his lare gehyrde, on his hirede wuniende, he Ge gehyrdon \u00fea bebodu \u00fee God bebead gefyrn \u00feam ealdan Israhele under Moyses lage, and hym \u00feus Ic secge eow to so\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t se bi\u00f0 domes scyldig, se \u00f0e nu yrsa\u00f0 wi\u00f0 his agenne bro\u00f0or. Se \u00f0e him hosp gecwy\u00f0, se bi\u00f0 \u00feeahtes scyldig, and se \u00f0e hine h\u00e6t stuntne, se bi\u00f0 wites scyldig on \u00feam Gif \u00f0u geoffrast Gode \u00e6nige lac \u00e6t his weofode, and \u00feu \u00feonne ge\u00feencst \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fein bro\u00f0or h\u00e6f\u00f0 sum \u00feing \u00deis godspel is nu ges\u00e6d sceortlice eow \u00feus; and we secga\u00f0 eow \u00fe\u00e6t sume men wendon \u00fe\u00e6t seo ealde \u00e6 We ne magon libban on \u00f0isum life nateshwon, \u00fe\u00e6t we ne agylton wi\u00f0 God and wi\u00f0 men on worde and \u00c6lce d\u00e6g we syngia\u00f0, and \u00e6lce d\u00e6g we sceolon urne H\u00e6lend gladian mid sumre godnysse, se \u00f0e \u00e6fre Se H\u00e6lend us s\u00e6de, swa swa ge gehyrdon \u00e6r, So\u00f0 ic eow secge, \u00fe\u00e6t ge sylfe ne becuma\u00f0 into heofonan \u00dea boceras syndon and \u00fea Sundorhalgan \u00fea ealdan witan, \u00fee w\u00e6ron gefyrn, under Moyses lage, swa \u00dea cidde hym se H\u00e6lend swi\u00f0e oftr\u00e6dlice, for \u00f0an \u00fee hy ne heoldon \u00fea halgan beboda swa swa God \u00dea s\u00e6de se H\u00e6lend, \u00fee geseah heora heortan, swi\u00f0e egeslice word",
